---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption="Where the answers in the matrix live. The higher a row lands in this stack, the more a checkmark depends on something beyond the Hyper-V role.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="stackTitle stackDesc">
    <title id="stackTitle">Where Microsoft virtualization capabilities live</title>
    <desc id="stackDesc">
      Four layers. At the bottom, the Hyper-V role provides the virtual switch, Live Migration,
      checkpoints and Hyper-V Replica. Above it, Windows Server features provide Failover
      Clustering, Storage Spaces Direct, Storage Replica and SDN. Those two layers are included
      with Windows Server 2025 Datacenter. Above them, System Center VMM provides Dynamic
      Optimization, library and templates, and clouds and RBAC. At the top, Azure and third-party
      products such as Azure Site Recovery, Azure Local and Veeam Recovery Orchestrator sit
      beyond Windows Server.
    </desc>

    <rect class="node" x="16" y="14" width="520" height="56" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="36" y="38">Azure and third party</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="57">Azure Site Recovery · Azure Local · Veeam Recovery Orchestrator</text>

    <rect class="node" x="16" y="78" width="520" height="56" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="36" y="102">System Center VMM</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="121">Dynamic Optimization · library and templates · clouds and RBAC</text>

    <rect class="node-edge" x="16" y="142" width="520" height="56" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="36" y="166">Windows Server features</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="185">Failover Clustering · Storage Spaces Direct · Storage Replica · SDN</text>

    <rect class="node-edge" x="16" y="206" width="520" height="56" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="36" y="230">Hyper-V role</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="249">Virtual switch · Live Migration · checkpoints · Hyper-V Replica</text>

    <path class="link" d="M546 14 L556 14 L556 134 L546 134" />
    <text class="tag-dim" x="568" y="70">Beyond</text>
    <text class="tag-dim" x="568" y="88">Windows Server</text>

    <path class="link-active" d="M546 142 L556 142 L556 262 L546 262" />
    <text class="tag" x="568" y="198">Windows Server</text>
    <text class="tag" x="568" y="216">2025 Datacenter</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>
